-## Project Store
-
-`projectStore` owns the client Project cache for the currently bound node:
-
-- `fetchProjects`, `fetchProject`, `createProject`, `updateProject`,
-  `deleteProject`, `addWorkspace`, `updateWorkspace`, `removeWorkspace`.
